 WHAT TO TUNE (6 parameters)
1. Hood Servo (4 values)

MIN_HOOD_ANGLE = 40.0 (measure with protractor)
MAX_HOOD_ANGLE = 60.0 (measure with protractor)
MIN_SERVO_POSITION = 0.2 (servo position at min angle)
MAX_SERVO_POSITION = 0.8 (servo position at max angle)

2. Flywheel Speed (2 values)

FLYWHEEL_SLOPE = 1.5 (from Excel chart)
FLYWHEEL_INTERCEPT = 100.0 (from Excel chart)

How to get these:

Shoot at 6 different speeds (500, 700, 900, 1100, 1300, 1500 RPM)
Measure range for each
Calculate launch speed: sqrt(range × 386.1)
Plot in Excel → add trendline → get equation y = mx + b


🎮 HOW TO USE IN TELEOP
Simple Version (copy-paste ready):
